  "scope": "Complete weighted coarea for Lipschitz f:R^m to R^n, m>n, and every Lebesgue-integrable real-valued g. Preserve integrability rather than summability, either infinite signed value, n=0 and actual Jacobian domains. The stronger supporting theorem retains original partial extended-real integrands and actual inner-integrability graphs. Characteristic fibre approximation, all fibre measurability, signed source density control, exact inner signed reconstruction and null-input transport are proved internally.",
